Package: dvbrx-web
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: BILLY Rémi <byhoster.association@gmail.com>
Section: video
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-numpy, passwd
Recommends: dvbrx
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/TrusterBSW/DVB-Rx
Description: web supervision page for the dvbrx DVB receiver
 dvbrx-web serves a web page (port 8099) that talks to the dvbrx daemons
 through their control sockets: the radio and each adapter at a glance,
 constellation, quick (FFT) and full scans of the cable, terrestrial and
 satellite bands with an export for tvheadend, and dish or antenna alignment.
 .
 The service is installed, not enabled: systemctl enable --now dvbrx-web.
